{
  "name": "pe-tag-baseline",
  "displayName": "Platform Engineering - mandatory tag baseline",
  "description": "Reference/optional Deny initiative for ALZ administrators: denies creation of resources and resource groups that are missing any of the mandatory platform tags (see the platform tag taxonomy). The subscription-baseline stack does not assign this initiative; assignment and effect rollout belong to the external ALZ owner (subscription-baseline acceptance criteria, ADR-0011). Built-in policy GUIDs are pinned and verified against the Azure/azure-policy repository.",
